---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftGardenPreference
---
Construct a GardenPreference draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Read member requests and prior agreements to identify desired uses, availability, and explicitly stated access needs. Separate preferences from accepted communal obligations and avoid inferring personal circumstances or assigning work without consent.
